'''Shade Form''' is a [[skill]] that grants a [[buff]] that provides immunity to [[physical damage]] and increased [[stealth]] when triggered.

==Sources==
[[Shroud of the Lightless]] has grants the skill with the internal id "ShadeForm".

{{il|Replica Eternity Shroud}} and the {{psl|Formless}} from the [[Blind Prophet]] Ascendancy class in [[Legacy of Phrecia]] leagues grants the skill with the internal id "ShadeFormWhenHit". 

The buff from this skill can also be granted via {{il|Omen of Death's Door}}.

==Mechanics==
Shade Form increases [[stealth]] by 100%, effectively reducing enemy aggro radius by 50%. It also grants immunity to [[physical damage]], negating it completely.

By default, the skill has a [[cooldown]] of 40 seconds and is affected by modifiers to [[cooldown recovery rate]]. This skill begins on cooldown when entering a new area.

The buff has a duration of 3 seconds by default. Modifiers to [[duration]] like {{il|More Duration Support}} and {{il|Efficacy Support}} affect the uptime of the buff, as well as [[self-curse|cursing yourself]] with {{il|Temporal Chains}}. However, it is not possible to maintain permanent uptime of this buff as the cooldown will not begin until the buff expires.

